<title>ITALY: Italian bonds/futures closing report.</title>
<headline>Italian bonds/futures closing report.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian bonds and futures ended a neutral session a touch lower after a day of falls, paring losses by the close on short-covering, traders said.</p>
<p>They said comments just on the close by the Buba's Kuehbacher saying EMU should probably start with a small group rather than be delayed would possibly add to prevailing gloom following huge gains made last week on EMU euphoria.</p>
<p>&quot;We saw a bit of arbitrage today. On Monday there was buying of Btps and selling of bunds but today it was the reverse. In the absence of a concrete trend the market's just doing technical trading and adjusting positions,&quot; one trader said.</p>
</text>
